<p>Master’s Program in Inflammation &amp; Inflammatory Diseases (IMI)
<!-- excerpt end --></p>

<p>The Inflammation and Inflammatory Diseases program aims to deepen knowledge in the field of inflammation and its involvement in various human pathologies. This program offers a transdisciplinary approach to the study of inflammatory processes at the interface between fundamental and applied/clinical research. This training is supported by the <a href="http://inflamex.fr/">Labex Inflamex</a>.</p>

